{{Dex/Entry1|v=Sun|entry=Reminiscent of the [[Ultra Beast]]s, this life-form, apparently asleep underground, is thought to have come from [[Ultra Space|another world]] in ancient times.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Moon|entry=Light is apparently the source of its energy. It has an extraordinarily vicious disposition and is constantly firing off {{m|Prismatic Laser|laser beams}}.}}
